type: software
title: "AI-Assisted DevOps in Production World"
authors:
  - family-names: Felix
    given-names: Ann
abstract: >-
  An engineering learning repository covering AI-assisted
  DevOps, site reliability engineering, platform engineering,
  and production operations. The collection emphasizes
  problem definition, evidence collection, AI interaction,
  engineer review, verification, implementation, testing,
  and human control over production changes.
